# kairos/docs/event_semantics.md section 3).  Configuration: the ENV tree, cFS bundle v7.0.1 (088b2fa8,
# env/build_cfs.sh), build native_std.  The same logical sites for the three candidates; labels are those of
# the F0 plan kairos/profiles/cfs-v7.0.1/observe/sites.kzp where the meaning is the same.
#
# What R2 needs (cases/R2.md section 5, plan/proof_status_R2.md section 12): the AppID actually passed at the
# three SB call sites of CFE_EVS_SendEventWithAppID that pass CFE_SB_Global.AppId, the SB task's store of its
# own id (cfe_sb_task.c:138, through CFE_ES_GetAppID's out parameter), the send function's entry for every
# caller, and the creation-side identity.  Values are the operands the original code uses; no string is
# copied.  Nothing here is a research condition.
